        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k tha̱a̱ŋ nath kɛ nyɔak ta̱th luak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ tɛ̈r Juda kɛnɛ Ben-ya-min ɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö nɛy tëë luny jɔk pe̱cä ta̱thkɛ luak Kuɔth Nhial, Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cukɛ ben kä Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl kɛnɛ bööth thuk duëli, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “A kɔ ta̱thkɔ kɛɛl kɛ yɛ. Kɛ ɣöö pal nɛy ni Kuothdun ce̱tkɛ yɛ, kä tho̱p nɛy ɛ muc ni mëë ku E-thar-ɣɛ̈-don kuäär A-thi-ri-ya nɛy nööŋ ɛn wa̱nɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl kɛnɛ Yɛ-cuwä kɛ duɔth bööthni thuk duëli kɛ loc i̱, “Thilɛ mi bia luäk nɛy kä ta̱th luaak Kuɔthda. Kɔn kä rɔ̱ ba̱kɔ Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl ta̱th luak, ce̱tnikɛ min ci Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath ɛ la̱r nɛy.” 5 kɛnɛ cio̱o̱k kä 24 latkɛ ni ta̱th luaak Kuɔth. Ɛ ruɔ̱n 521-484 a/ka̱n Yecu ni dap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ wec ɛ ɣɔ̱n i̱ ba ji̱ Juda jak kä dual kɛ ta̱th luaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ nɛy ti bikɛ luek kä ta̱th luaak Kuɔth kɔk, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ jak kä ŋɔ̱a̱ŋ kä la̱tdiɛn kɛ ni̱n ruëc Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath diaal cu mäni ni ruëc Dɔr-ya-wɛc kuäär Pa-rath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pa-rath.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛn ti̱ti̱, ca kɛ wä lat kä cio̱o̱k kä 24, min latni ɣöö cio̱o̱k kä.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k tha̱a̱ŋ nath kɛ nyɔak ta̱th Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm bä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ tuk Ä-ɣɛ̈c-we-roc",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ä-ɣɛ̈c-we-roc.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kä tin te kä cio̱o̱k kä 6:23 latkɛ ni ta̱th wec kä bëë kɛ kɔr ri̱cni da̱ŋ rɛw. Kɛ ruɔ̱n 485-464 min la ruec Ä-ɣɛ̈c-we-roc.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kɛ kuäär, cukɛ warɛgak mi gɔny kɛn ɛ ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm gɔ̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ni̱n kuäärä Är-tɛ̈k-cɛ̈th-tɛ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Är-tɛ̈k-cɛ̈th-tɛ.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kä kɛ run Är-tɛ̈k-cɛ̈th-tɛ ɛ 464-423 a/ka̱n Yecu ni dap.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuäär Pa-rath, cu Bic-lam kɛnɛ Mith-rɛ-dath kɛ Tab-el kɛ duɔth bunädiɛn warɛgak gɔ̱a̱r Är-tɛ̈k-cɛ̈th-tɛ. Ɛn warɛgak ca gɔ̱r kɛ thok ji̱ Ä-ram nikɛ ba̱ni ji̱ Ä-ram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ-ɣum bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m kɛnɛ Cim-cay bulkamiin, warɛgak mi gɔanykɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ jɛ gɔ̱a̱r kuäär ni Är-tɛ̈k-cɛ̈th-tɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Rɛ-ɣum bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m kɛnɛ Cim-cay bulkamiin, kɛ duɔth bunädiɛn warɛgak gɔ̱r kɛɛl kɛ ruëëc, kɛ kua̱r, kɛ ji̱ kɔar kua̱r, kɛ Pa-rath, kɛ ji̱ Ɛ̈-rɛk kɛ ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛ ji̱ Cu-cɛ̈n, min la Ee-lam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ nɛy ti ŋuan ti kɔ̱ŋ ti cua nooŋ ɛ, ji̱ Ɔth-nɛ̈-par min luɔ̱thkɛ kä cuɛ jak kä cieŋ wi̱i̱ni Tha-mɛ-ria kɛnɛ jɔk yiëër Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kä nɛmɛ ɛ min te rɛy warɛgakä min wä kä jɛ.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wee kä kuäär ni Är-tɛ̈k-cɛ̈th-tɛ. Jäk la̱a̱tku tin te wi̱i̱ni jɔk Kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh ji̱ kä maliɛn. Kä täämɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋäcni jɛ kuäär ɛn ɣöö ji̱ Juudh tëë jiɛy kä ji̱ kä ci ben kä kɔ ti, cikɛ wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Nyɔk kɛn wec tɛ̈r ɛ jiääk ɛmɔ kɛ ta̱th. Cikɛ pänydɛ cuŋ kä bany kɛn ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋäcni jɛ ɛn ɣöö mi wa nyɔk kɛ ta̱th kä bi pänydɛ loc thi̱n, /cikɛ tho̱lbo̱k bi thöp kɛnɛ karaamni, bi yio̱w kuäärä kuɛ̈ɛ̈. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö kɛ kɔn la̱a̱t kua̱r, /cɛ ro̱ŋ ɛn ɣöö bi nɛy nɛmɛ nɛn a tuɔɔkɛ kä ji̱, kɛ kui̱c ɛ mɔ ɛ jɛn lär nɛy ɛ ji̱ mɔ kuäär, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö bi bok ruaacni guuri go̱r. Kä biɛ ŋa̱c rɛy buɔk ruaacni ɛn ɣöö wec ɛmɔ ɛ wec tɛ̈r mi jiääk, ɛ wec mi moc kua̱r riɛk mi la rɔ a luc naath ni wal. Ɛ jɛn mëë da̱kɛ jɛn wec ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ ba̱kɔ ji̱ la̱r lär lö kuäär, ɛn ɣöö mi wa wec ɛmɔ wä nyɔk kɛ ta̱th, a bi pänydɛ thuɔ̱k, bi thil gua̱a̱th kä wi̱i̱ tin te Kui̱ Kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär luɔc ja̱k wëë i̱, “Warɛgak wëë kä Rɛ-ɣum bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m kɛnɛ bulkamiin ni Cim-cay kɛ duɔth bunädiɛn in cieŋ kä Tha-mɛ-ria, kɛ duɔth wi̱i̱ni tin te Kui̱ Kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh, malɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ warɛgak in cia jäk kä nɛy ca kuɛn ni kɛɛliw ni nhiamdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä ruac lat kä ca go̱r, kä ca jek ɛn ɣöö wec ɛmɔ la rɔ a lucɛ kua̱r, kä ɛ gua̱a̱th mi la rik a lät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
